y%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/developing-today%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Design doc for the Atlas embedding cost ledger (#6058), per task 13943's packet acceptance:\n\n- Per-batch ledger schema: `batch_id, source_class, chunks_new, chunks_reused, tokens_embedded, model, usd` (+ `usd_per_1m_tokens`, `outcome`, `attestation_ref`, `recorded_at`).\n- Batch identity is shared with #6045's attestation record (no second batch key); new-vs-reused classification is #6028's span-matching semantics.\n- The delta reuse-ratio alert stated explicitly: `reuse_ratio = chunks_reused / (chunks_new + chunks_reused)`; alert when `< 0.90` on an append-mostly source class, framed as \"delta protocol broken, not budget\".\n- Per-source-class baseline slots defined and left UNPOPULATED (blocked on first real ingest batches, #6025 / #6028).\n- Model + computed `usd` frozen per batch, so route changes (#6059, #6069) never rewrite history.\n- Six named invariants with oracles; worked example; non-goals (no implementation, no invented baselines).\n\nDocs-only: no code paths touched. Cross-references #6019, #6025, #6028, #6045, #6059, #6069 all verified OPEN with matching scope (2026-11-09).\n\nCloses #6058\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796778591&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7893&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7893&signature=e72bc58bd4084c18ff7dc06e760c215f5f1beb9393258b55554c9b1869815883\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix wi